# Docker build-context exclusions (research D9)
# Keep the context lean: no node_modules, no host build artifacts, no secrets,
# no dev/test tooling. NOTE: entrypoint.sh is intentionally NOT excluded — it is
# COPY'd into the runtime image by the Dockerfile.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
# NOTE: backend/tests is intentionally NOT excluded — the backend tsconfig
# includes tests/**, so `tsc` (run in the Docker build stage) needs them present.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
.specify
specs
docs
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.dev.yml
